{"data":{"repository":{"n11175":{"__typename":"PullRequest","number":11175,"title":"Fix the PreconditionError exception-identity split at the shared contracts seam","state":"MERGED","url":"https://github.com/D-sorganization/UpstreamDrift/pull/11175","body":"## Summary\n- `src/shared/python/_contracts_exceptions.py` redefined `PreconditionError`/`PostconditionError`/`InvariantError`/`ContractViolationError` in parallel with the public `src.shared.python.contracts` module.\n- Decorators that raise (`@precondition`/`@postcondition`) resolve classes from `contracts`, so callsites importing the shard class (`from src.shared.python._contracts_exceptions import PreconditionError`) caught NOTHING: `tests/unit/motion_matching/test_stability_matrix.py::TestStabilityMatrix::test_get_canonical_test_invalid` has stayed red on main since the #11171 restore.\n- Fix: the shard now re-exports the SAME class objects (`ContractEvaluationError` remains shard-local with its message validation). Both import paths remain usable and referentially identical.\n- TDD: the test now asserts `contracts.PreconditionError is _contracts_exceptions.PreconditionError` and that the invalid invocation raises THAT class. Red on main HEAD (27632bd195), green after fix.\n\n## Verification\n- `pytest tests/unit/motion_matching/test_stability_matrix.py` — 27 passed (was red on main).\n- Shard contract suites (`tests/shared/wave10_remaining/test_contracts_exceptions.py`, wave10_contracts exceptions/decorators/validators/invariant-mixin) — 95 passed.\n- ruff check + format clean on changed files.\n- Pre-existing main failures left untouched: `test_contracts_module.py::test_all_exports_exist`, two `test_level.py` -O subprocess cases (reproduce red on unmodified main).\n\nRefs the main CI red noted after #11171 (27632bd195).","mergedAt":"2026-09-30T09:31:37Z","mergeCommit":{"oid":"0446a2b5e46a1192ff58c84f614975bd0be2b2a4"},"author":{"login":"dieterolson"},"files":{"nodes":[{"path":"AGENT_HANDOFF.md"},{"path":"SPEC.md"},{"path":"docs/development/DEVELOPMENT_LOG.md"},{"path":"src/shared/python/_contracts_exceptions.py"},{"path":"tests/unit/motion_matching/test_stability_matrix.py"}]},"closingIssuesReferences":{"nodes":[]}},"n11171":{"number":11171,"title":"Fix the c2a102a1b9 rewrite regression: datasets deleted from main, 8 tests red","state":"MERGED","mergedAt":"2026-09-30T08:39:39Z","mergeCommit":{"oid":"27632bd19517bc623161ec9a3b3624e918529c85"},"files":{"nodes":[{"path":"data/Club_Data.xlsx"},{"path":"docs/development/monolith_refactor_register.md"},{"path":"docs/shared_tools/divergence_inventory.md"},{"path":"docs/shared_tools/divergence_inventory.v1.json"},{"path":"reports/matched_swing_ledger.json"},{"path":"src/engines/Simscape_Multibody_Models/3D_Golf_Model/matlab/Data/Mocap C3D Files/C3DExport Tour average.c3d"},{"path":"src/engines/Simscape_Multibody_Models/3D_Golf_Model/matlab/Data/Mocap C3D Files/C3DExport tour average iron.c3d"},{"path":"src/engines/Simscape_Multibody_Models/3D_Golf_Model/matlab/Data/Mocap C3D Files/Gears Capture Files/.MATLABDriveTag"},{"path":"src/engines/Simscape_Multibody_Models/3D_Golf_Model/matlab/Data/Mocap C3D Files/Gears Capture Files/2019-03-14/.MATLABDriveTag"},{"path":"src/engines/Simscape_Multibody_Models/3D_Golf_Model/matlab/Data/Mocap C3D Files/Gears Capture Files/2019-03-14/1 Capture.gpcap"},{"path":"src/engines/Simscape_Multibody_Models/3D_Golf_Model/matlab/Data/Mocap C3D Files/Gears Capture Files/2019-03-14/1 Capture.info"},{"path":"src/engines/Simscape_Multibody_Models/3D_Golf_Model/matlab/Data/Mocap C3D Files/Gears Capture Files/2019-03-14/10 Capture.gpcap"},{"path":"src/engines/Simscape_Multibody_Models/3D_Golf_Model/matlab/Data/Mocap C3D Files/Gears Capture Files/2019-03-14/10 Capture.info"},{"path":"src/engines/Simscape_Multibody_Models/3D_Golf_Model/matlab/Data/Mocap C3D Files/Gears Capture Files/2019-03-14/11 Capture.gpcap"},{"path":"src/engines/Simscape_Multibody_Models/3D_Golf_Model/matlab/Data/Mocap C3D Files/Gears 